  {
   "where": "做法第 1 步",
   "before": "onChange 只负责同步状态。",
   "after": "onChange 只负责同步状态；源端 onValueChange 里除了按条件写回还有别的动作（如清掉错误提示、触发查询）时，这些动作照样留在 onChange 里，不随拒绝条件一起移走。",
   "basis": "卡里成立的前提：两张卡的源端 onValueChange 只有拒绝判断和写回，没有其他动作（case-e3cd92963aa40d922fdc、case-e332c2cc4929f36c08c7）",
   "type": "加条件"
  },
  {
   "where": "做法第 2 步",
   "before": "在 onWillChange 中用与源码相同的判断返回 false 拒绝本次变更",
   "after": "在 onWillChange（API 15 起提供）中用与源码相同的判断返回 false 拒绝本次变更",
   "basis": "https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/reference/apis-arkui/arkui-ts/ts-basic-components-textinput.md，onWillChange；鸿蒙 SDK 的 ets/component/text_input.d.ts，TextInputAttribute.onWillChange",
   "type": "加条件"
  }
 ],
 "entries": [
  {
   "step": "原因",
   "fact": "父组件持有的值不变（onChange 里不写回）时，TextInput 不会回显旧值，被拒的字符仍留在输入框里",
   "source": "卡里修好并验证过（case-e332c2cc4929f36c08c7）",
   "kind": "卡里验证",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "做法第 1 步",
   "fact": "TextInput.maxLength 取值 [0, 2^31-1]，不设或设异常值时不限长度，设小数时取整数部分",
   "source": "https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/reference/apis-arkui/arkui-ts/ts-basic-components-textinput.md，maxLength；鸿蒙 SDK 的 ets/component/text_input.d.ts，TextInputAttribute.maxLength",
   "kind": "鸿蒙接口",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "做法第 1 步",
   "fact": "TextInput 设了 .maxLength(N) 后，在设备上输入到 N 个字符再追加，框内文本仍是 N 个字符",
   "source": "卡里修好并验证过（case-e3cd92963aa40d922fdc）",
   "kind": "卡里验证",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "做法第 1 步",
   "fact": "TextInput.inputFilter 按正则过滤输入：匹配的才显示；单字符输入时只按单个字符匹配，粘贴等多字符输入按整串匹配；API 11 起设了 inputFilter 且输入不为空时，type 自带的文本过滤失效",
   "source": "https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/reference/apis-arkui/arkui-ts/ts-basic-components-textinput.md，inputFilter；鸿蒙 SDK 的 ets/component/text_input.d.ts，TextInputAttribute.inputFilter",
   "kind": "鸿蒙接口",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "做法第 2 步",
   "fact": "TextInput.onWillChange（API 15 起）在文本变更前触发：返回 false 拦截这次变化，框内文本不变；返回 true 放行，随后触发 onChange",
   "source": "https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/reference/apis-arkui/arkui-ts/ts-basic-components-textinput.md，onWillChange",
   "kind": "鸿蒙接口",
